OL,3,GNEWSABurst pipe leaves Enfield families
OL,4,Awithout water
OL,5,
OL,6,FA north London resident whose family is
OL,7,Fone of about 750 households that have
OL,8,Fspent three days without water due to a
OL,9,Fburst pipe has said they have had to
OL,10,Fresort to buying bottled water to flush
OL,11,Ftheir toilet.
OL,13,FFilomena Gianfrancesco, 56, said she
OL,14,Fand her family of six have been without
OL,15,Fwater in Enfield since Sunday.
OL,17,F"I had never realised how difficult it
OL,18,Fwas to be without water, and on day
OL,19,Fthree today things are beginning to get
OL,20,Fquite hard," she said. "No washing, no
OL,21,Ftoilet, no washing up, no laundry."
