OL,3,GNEWSABurst pipe leaves Enfield families
OL,4,Awithout water
OL,5,
OL,6,FThames Water said in an update on its
OL,7,Fwebsite that repair work on the damaged
OL,8,Fpipe would begin on Tuesday evening and
OL,9,Fwas expected to take "several days".
